{"type":"standard","title":"Gregg Hull","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gregg Hull</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q138611488","titles":{"canonical":"Gregg_Hull","normalized":"Gregg Hull","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gregg Hull</span></span>"},"pageid":82616253,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383242025","tid":"2188aaf9-d623-11f1-b511-12e6f97d0f90","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:36:20Z","description":"American politician and businessman","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregg_Hull","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregg_Hull?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregg_Hull?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gregg_Hull"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregg_Hull","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Gregg_Hull","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gregg_Hull?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gregg_Hull"}},"extract":"Greggory D. Hull is an American politician and businessman who served as mayor of Rio Rancho, New Mexico, from 2014 to April 2026, making him the longest-serving mayor in Rio Rancho history. Hull is the Republican nominee in the 2026 New Mexico gubernatorial election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Greggory D. Hull</b> is an American politician and businessman who served as mayor of Rio Rancho, New Mexico, from 2014 to April 2026, making him the longest-serving mayor in Rio Rancho history. Hull is the Republican nominee in the 2026 New Mexico gubernatorial election.</p>"}